      "Explains circuit construction, gates, measurements, composition, and parameterized circuits.",
      "Covers Sampler and Estimator primitives for local and runtime execution.",
      "Describes transpilation, backend selection, job handling, sessions, and batch execution.",
      "Provides patterns for VQE, QAOA, Grover, chemistry, machine learning, and optimization.",
      "Summarizes visualization options for circuits, counts, quantum states, and backend maps."
    ],
    "limitations": [
